0.000000000000 3.991069605153 0.000000000000
0.000000000000 0.000000000000 3.991069605153
ATOMIC_POSITIONS crystal
Si 0.000000000000 0.000000000000 0.000000000000
Al 0.000000000000 0.500000000000 0.500000000000
Al 0.500000000000 0.000000000000 0.500000000000
Al 0.500000000000 0.500000000000 0.000000000000
K_POINTS automatic
